# DFX reconfigurable-module allowlist (P3 coarse action dimension).
# sha256(partial .bin)  module-name
# Only modules listed here may be hot-swapped into the RP via
# `agentctl.py load-module`. Mirrors the P2 frame guard / measured-load gate:
# the agent physically cannot fpgautil -f Partial a module that isn't measured.
#
# Static design = zynq_xpart DFX (PS7 + NEORV32 + XBUS + AXI-GPIO mailbox @0x41200000),
# RP cell = u_soc/wb_tpu_inst. Observable = mailbox word @0x41200000.
